#. native-sha256: afeec38a82ec9a69fb9c5274c5f4c96c8ff116ea861844046ff0b6f2295b6b2d
#. default-sha256: a86edb899358f219fe5e451c7cc7160cf9fe7852679f6b72ae0c784df9ffa737
msgctxt "search:search_EA7B882C_C77E_48DC_95BF_60A87ECDA9C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫You "
"lost, or you just tryin’ to take in the sights?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Qu’est-ce qui s’passe ?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"T’es perdu ou bien t’admires le paysage ?"

#: search:search_703E19E0_726C_433E_BAC7_50B93A16C2B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07d48638899cfc2b57dedbdc6ff25d3d5ce1c755058cfaf5042f670bfac758d1
#. default-sha256: 631fc3768e844e48f67276c7ff2578d57228f1ffc68a552e3b4afb31eb8e51b9
msgctxt "search:search_703E19E0_726C_433E_BAC7_50B93A16C2B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A voice called out to ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫but it was not the Maid’s "
"voice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une voix ⟪k:1⟫s’adresse à vous⟪k:2⟫s’adresse au Défunt⟪k:3⟫—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ mais ce n’est pas "
"celle de la Servante."

#: search:search_93F85EDE_C4D7_4905_B000_4CBEB0BF467F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f55989bf038dfc1920ca2664e8bfbc278fc033eed8e8d647df8b1dae588c68b
