msgctxt "search:search_93F85EDE_C4D7_4905_B000_4CBEB0BF467F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...What?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Quoi ?"

#: search:search_B07EC243_739B_4E71_8C88_18A02077BB67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d6d5f339b8682ab9f6256cb99d6582f74139a81e296d9a363105fb7f3f641d4
#. default-sha256: c1c3f70e55baf53a6eef37a6372aaa5cdd71a5eece8a6fcbd94ba78fa10cd6c3
msgctxt "search:search_B07EC243_739B_4E71_8C88_18A02077BB67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Caught off-guard, ⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ spun around, confused, in search of the source."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pris sur le vif, ⟪k:2⟫vous vous retournez⟪k:3⟫il se retourne⟪k:4⟫, perplexe, et ⟪k:5⟫"
"vous cherchez⟪k:6⟫il cherche⟪k:7⟫ d’où vient la voix."

#: search:search_30150091_426D_424D_BA43_80800C085731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0b049d8237687cbc8cfe88424556f352c6a8b77b8b8fffbeb5d45c29e0ba83f
#. default-sha256: bcda7f5ebece2eab6c301ec1e64d2afe6ac2731c2a6bc9061400eed7696a8e3c
msgctxt "search:search_30150091_426D_424D_BA43_80800C085731"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Where you looking?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m over here. Yeah, there you go.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Little more to the "
"left."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qu’est-c’tu fais ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Suis par ici. Ouais, par là.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Un peu plus à gauche."

#: search:search_49F955BE_4E05_4E8D_ABE8_12721B082B88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f71406035309c61e5f8ec4580cc609f6e24a04583f298a6a3e8e5bb10d6e0c47
#. default-sha256: 2103fa8e1d286f4ea138db77ae9018805d9460f4cab7ba2fcd6c1e584a9ff47f
msgctxt "search:search_49F955BE_4E05_4E8D_ABE8_12721B082B88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Following the voice’s instructions, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ found ⟪k:4⟫Yourself⟪k:5⟫"
"himself⟪k:6⟫ facing a wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En suivant les instructions de la voix, ⟪k:1⟫vous vous retrouvez⟪k:2⟫il se retrouve⟪k:3⟫ "
"devant un mur."

