#: search:search_F6A058C8_2CC7_42DB_83AB_176712F953A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e14e1a21daa08515da43e6ca0db898a0038a04a16e24b30d8e4e0d5ef34bee6c
