#: search:search_51712C12_CBA0_4DDD_A7DB_6DCDE8268617
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 874e2379e0301fbe69750fa621c1957192317fd414ecf24115fe211fe5f20471
